  click C_SCENE href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/ContentView.swift#L235" "The scene-active Task: CalendarService.refreshRollingWindow (Apple Calendar, once the synced edge is a day short of the 180-day target, NudgeConfig.calendarImportHorizonDays) or refreshICalFeedIfNeeded (iCal link, once per day), both of which insert rows through importAppleCalendar / writeICalEvents. ExamPrepSweep.run runs synchronously on cold launch (.task(id: notificationToken)) and on every foreground, before the arbiter; HomeTabView.sendMessage and TasksTabView.createSessionItem also run it after a capture." _blank
  click C_SHOT href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Views/Tabs/CalendarTabView.swift#L780" "handleScreenshotPicked: the Calendar tab's photo picker hands the image to ScreenshotCalendarImporter.importFromImage, then reevaluates the arbiter." _blank
  click C_BOX href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Views/Tabs/TasksTabView.swift#L256" "answerPlanProposal: the message box's Yes calls accept and reevaluates; No calls decline, which records the decision and writes no row." _blank
  click G_REQUEST href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/PlanProposalSweep.swift#L395" "requestPlan, from HomeTabView.sendMessage when the chat's plan question is answered Yes: asks Claude to build the sessions for the one parent and writes them through accept at once, then announces them in the message box." _blank
  click F_IMPORT href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/CalendarService.swift#L509" "applyImportedSchedule(to:start:isAllDay:), called by importAppleCalendar (L311) and writeICalEvents (L474) after the row is built (L295, L456) with dueDate = start of the day, specificTime = the start unless all-day, source calendar, estimatedMinutes from the real span. Events return as they are. A task with a real span gets setPlanStart(start, duration, auto: false); a zero-length or all-day task gets setPlanDay(start). Duplicates by title and due day are skipped." _blank
  click F_SHOTIMP href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/ScreenshotCalendarImporter.swift#L110" "importFromImage: every parsed entry becomes an event (isInformationalEvent true) with dueDate = its day, dueTime specific, specificTime = the start, source screenshot. Duplicates skipped." _blank
  click F_ACCEPT href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/PlanProposalSweep.swift#L527" "accept(proposal). One row per session: source prep, linkedEventId = parent id, estimatedMinutes, parent's category and stakes, no deadline, setPlanDay(session day). Skips tombstoned days and existing (day, title) pairs." _blank
  click F_COMMIT href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/ExamPrepSweep.swift#L389" "commitmentPhase, inside ExamPrepSweep.run. A captured commitment parent whose numbers are known is expanded: a NudgeCommitment row is inserted and the parent deleted. Then one source commitment daily per missing day: dueDate = 23:59 of its own day, no intendedDate, linkedEventId = commitment id, estimatedMinutes, targetCount for quantity shapes. Split work generates once; rate and quantity top up a 14-day horizon (NudgeConfig.commitmentHorizonDays) on every run. See the generated-rows close-up." _blank
  click H_DAY href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/NudgeTask.swift#L180" "setPlanDay(day): intendedDate = startOfDay(day), planDayIsAuto = false; a placement on another day is cleared." _blank
  click H_START href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/NudgeTask.swift#L194" "setPlanStart(start, durationMinutes, auto: false): intendedDate = the start's day, plannedStartDate, plannedDurationMinutes, plannedIsAuto false." _blank
  click S_UNPLANNED href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/NudgeTask.swift#L151" "A commitment daily: owed at 23:59 of its day, no plan day, so belongs(to:) puts it in Today on that day by its anchor." _blank
